                            <locus from="90r" to="250"/>
                            <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta">Tārika Walda ʾAmid (β-recension)</title>    
                            <note>Complete text of the pre-Islamic part, from the creation of the world to the reign of Emperor Heraclius. 
                                The Geographical treatise on <locus from="96r" to="98v"/> was edited in
                                <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/GXG3M9ES"><seg type="thesis"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Hoffmann2021Amid"/><title level="m">Das geographische Traktat in der Weltgeschichte des Wäldä Amid: Text, Übersetzung und Kommentar</title><author><t:forename xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">Carsten</t:forename><t:surname xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">Hoffmann</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Marburg</pubPlace><date>2023</date><note type="url">https://archiv.ub.uni-marburg.de/ubfind/Record/urn:nbn:de:hebis:04-z2023-0080/View</note></bibl> and given the siglum 'O'. Based on the textual evidence from 
                                this section, the witness was assigned to the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6935TarWaAmidAlpha">α-recension</ref>.
                                However, it begins in a similar way to the <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6936TarWaAmidBeta">β-recension</ref>,
                                and the scribe <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS00000000000000000000">Habta Mikāʾel</persName>, who 
                                copied the text at the request of <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6064Krapf">Johann Ludwig Krapf</persName>, stated in a 
                                <ref target="#coloph1">colophon</ref> on <locus from="250v39" to="251r4"/> that it 'was written from many 
                                books' (<foreign xml:lang="gez">ዘተጽሐፈ፡ እምብዙኃት፡ መጻሕፍት፡</foreign>). 
                                This suggests that O is most likely an interpolated version of both α and β.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                            <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመአብ፡ ወወልድ፡ ወመንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ፩ አምላክ፡ በቅድስት፡ ሥላሴ፡ እንዘ፡ አአምን፡ ወእትመኃፀን። እክህደከ፡ ሰይጣን፡
                                በቅድመ፡ ዛቲ፡ እምየ፡ ቅድስት፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ እንተ፡ ይእቲ፡ ሰምእየ፡ ማርያም፡ ጽ<gap reason="illegible" unit="chars" quantity="1"/>ን፡
                                ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን። ንወጥን፡ በረድኤተ፡ ኢግዚአብሔር፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዘውእቱ፡ ዜናሆሙ፡ ለአበው፡ ቀደምት። ወሀሰበ፡ ኍልቈ፡ መዋዕሊሆሙ፡ 
                                ለነገሥት፡ እምአዳም፡ እስከ፡ ተፍጻሜቶሙ፡ ዘእስራኤል፡ ወዘአሕዛብ፡ ዘአስተጋብአ፡ ኅሩይ፡ ወትሩፍ፡ ክርስቲያናዊት፡ ክርስቶሳዊ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ ወልደ፡ አሚድ፡
                                ዘብሔረ፡ ግብጽ።</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="gez">ወተመይጠ፡ ኀርቃል፡ ኀቤየ፡ እምደማስቆ፡ ወሀገረ፡ ኅምጽ፡ ወሀማህ፡ ወሀለብ፡ ወካልአን፡ አህጉር። ወለሠነዮሙ፡ ለአድያም፡
                                ወሀደገ፡ ግብረ። ለድኩማን። ወእምቅድመ፡ ይትፈጸም፡ ፲ወ፩ ዓመተ፡ መንግሥቱ፡ ተከሥተ፡ ክሕደተሰ። ኀበ፡ ምድረ፡ ግብፅ፡ ወተፃብኦ፡ ምስሌሆሙ። ወምኦሙ።
                                ወጸሐፈ፡ ለብንያም፡ ሊቀ፡ ጳጳስት፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ኪዳን። ወመጽአ፡ ብንያም፡ ኀበ፡ እስክንድርያ፡ እምድኅረ፡ ጐዩ፡ እመንበሩ፡ ፲ወ፩ ዓመት። ወእምድኅረ፡ ዝንቱ፡ 
                                ፈለሰ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ኆልቈ፡ ዓመታት፡ ወዜናሆሙ፡ ለነገሥት፡ ወካልኦሙ፡ ኀበ፡ ትንባላት። ወኮነ፡ ምጽአቶሙ፡ ለተንባላት፡ ኀበ፡ ምድረ፡ ግብፅ፡ በተፍጻሜተ፡ ፲ወ፩ 
                                ዓመት፡ እመንግሥተ፡ ህርቃል፡ ወይእቲ፡ ቀዳሚት፡ ዓመት፡ እምዓመታት፡ ተንባላት፡ ወበ፫፻፶ወ፯ ዓመት፡ ለዲዮ፡ ቅልጥያኖስ። ወበ፬፻፴ወ፫ ዓመቱ፡ ለእስክንድር፡
                                ወበ፯፻፲ወ፬ ዓመት፡ እምልደተ፡ እግዚእነ፡ እየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ሎቱ፡ ስብሐት። ወበተፍጻሜተ፡ ፰፻ወ፩፻፲ወ፬ ዓመት፡ እምፍጥረተ፡ ዓለም። ። ። ።</explicit>
                            <colophon xml:id="coloph1">
                                <locus from="250v39" to="251r4"/>
                                <foreign xml:lang="gez">ለገብርከ፡ <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6064Krapf">ክራጵፍ። ዮሐንስ።</persName> ለሊሰ። 
                                    ዝመጽሐፍ፡ ዘ<persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6064Krapf">ክራጵፍ።</persName> ወለጸሐፊሁ፡ 
                                    <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS0000000000000000000000">ሀብተ፡ ሚካኤል።</persName>ፋጡላ፡ ተፈጸመ፡ 
                                    <choice resp="CH"><sic>ረ</sic><corr>ለ</corr></choice>ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዘአስተጋብአ፡ ብእሲ፡ ክቡር፡ ወትሩፍ፡ 
                                    ክርስቲያናዊ። ኦርቶዶክሳዊ። ጊዮርጊስ፡ ግብፃዊ። ወኮነ፡ ተፍጻሚተ፡ ውእቱ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዘተጽሕፈ፡ እምኔሁ፡ ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ለአመ፡ ፩ ለወርኃ፡ ግንቦት፡
                                    በ፻፲ወ፲ወ፩ ዓመት፡ እምሰማዕታት፡ ኅሩያን፡ ወአመ፡ <date when="1391-09-15" when-custom="793-10-07" calendar="islamic">
                                    ፯ ለወርኀ፡ ሰዋል። ወበ፯፻፺ወ፫ እምሰማዕታተ፡ ተንባላት።</date> ወዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ዘተጽሐፈ፡ እምብዙኃት፡ 
                                    መጻሕፍት፡ ዘያ<add place="inline"><unclear>ዐ</unclear></add>ድዕ፡ ኵሎ፡ ነገረ፡ ኅቡአት። ሰብሐት፡ ለእእግዚአብሔር፡ ባበሬ፡ 
                                    መላእክት፡ አበ፡ ኵሉ፡ ሠርጐ፡ ፍጥረታት፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን። ።</foreign>
                                <note>The dates probably need to be emended to 
                                    <date when="1294-08-29" when-custom="1011-01-01" calendar="diocletian">1st Maskaram 1011</date> and 
                                    <date when="1294-08-30" when-custom="693-10-07" calendar="islamic">7th Šawwāl 693</date> and refer to the 
                                    production of an early copy of the Arabic version of <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4723TarikaWaldaAmid#t3">Tārīḫ Ibn al-ʿAmīd</ref>
                                    and not to any Ethiopic copy (cf. <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/GXG3M9ES"><seg type="thesis"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Hoffmann2021Amid"/><title level="m">Das geographische Traktat in der Weltgeschichte des Wäldä Amid: Text, Übersetzung und Kommentar</title><author><t:forename xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">Carsten</t:forename><t:surname xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">Hoffmann</t:surname></author><pubPlace>Marburg</pubPlace><date>2023</date><note type="url">https://archiv.ub.uni-marburg.de/ubfind/Record/urn:nbn:de:hebis:04-z2023-0080/View</note><citedRange unit="page">58-59</citedRange></bibl>), contrary to <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/XBDKDA79"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia"/><title level="m">Bibliografia etiopica, in continuazione alla «Bibliografia etiopica» di G. Fumagalli, II: Manoscritti etiopici</title><author><forename>Silvio</forename><surname>Zanutto</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Ministero delle Colonie–Sindacato Italiano Arti Grafiche</publisher><date>1932</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Ethiopian studies</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliography</note><note type="tag">bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia</note></note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Ethiopian studies</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Bibliography</note><note type="tag">bm:Zanutto1932Bibliografia</note><citedRange unit="number">65</citedRange><citedRange unit="page">43</citedRange></bibl>, who reported: 
                                    'On the right-hand side of the last folio, a note was added stating that this manuscript was copied by 
                                    <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS00000000000000000000">Habta Mikâʼel</persName> 
                                    on the instructions of <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6064Krapf">Johann Ludwig Krapf</persName>, based on a manuscript from the 15th (!) century'
                                    and <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/5UCS2MUF"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Ewald1844Tuebingen"/><title level="a">Ueber die Aethiopischen Handschriften zu Tübingen</title><title level="j">Zeitschrift für die Kunde des Morgenlandes</title><author><forename>Heinrich</forename><surname>Ewald</surname></author><date>1844</date><biblScope unit="volume">5</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">164-201</biblScope><note type="url">https://archive.org/details/zeitschriftfrd05gtuoft</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">bm:Ewald1844Tuebingen</note></note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">bm:Ewald1844Tuebingen</note><citedRange unit="page">200-201</citedRange></bibl>, 
                                    who wrote: ‘According to the signature, the manuscript of Elmakin's works, from which the present one is taken, was 
                                    completed in the year 1010 (!) of the Diocletian era and 765 (!) of the Arabic era, and is therefore relatively very 
                                    old.'
                                    However, the claim that the antigraph was a 15th-century manuscript is doubtful. If this were true, the antigraph would
                                    be significantly older than all the known textual witnesses.</note>
